### 1. Health Check (Sistem Durumu)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Basic Strategy - Güneş Fazlası & Batarya Şarj Senaryosu
POST http://localhost:5000/api/energy/simulate-step
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "strategy": "BASIC",
  "environment": {
    "timestamp": "2026-11-07T12:00:00Z",
    "solarGenerationKWh": 85.0,
    "isGridAvailable": true,
    "gridElectricityPrice": 0.18,
    "battery": {
      "currentCapacityKWh": 20.0,
      "maxCapacityKWh": 100.0,
      "minReservePercent": 20
    },
    "buildings": [
      { "id": "b1", "name": "Biyoteknoloji Laboratuvarı", "type": "LABORATORY", "isCritical": true, "demandKWh": 25 },
      { "id": "b2", "name": "Merkez Kütüphane", "type": "LIBRARY", "isCritical": true, "demandKWh": 15 },
      { "id": "b3", "name": "Öğrenci Yurdu A Blok", "type": "DORMITORY", "isCritical": false, "demandKWh": 20 }
    ]
  }
}

###

### 3. Smart Strategy - Şebeke Kesintisi & Öncelikli Yük Atma (Load Shedding)
# Bu senaryoda şebeke kesiktir, güneş yetersizdir.
# Laboratuvar ve Kütüphane %100 beslenirken, Öğrenci Yurdu kesintiye uğrar.
POST http://localhost:5000/api/energy/simulate-step
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "strategy": "SMART",
  "environment": {
    "timestamp": "2026-11-07T14:30:00Z",
    "solarGenerationKWh": 15.0,
    "isGridAvailable": false,
    "gridElectricityPrice": 0.25,
    "battery": {
      "currentCapacityKWh": 25.0,
      "maxCapacityKWh": 100.0,
      "minReservePercent": 20
    },
    "buildings": [
      { "id": "b1", "name": "Biyoteknoloji Laboratuvarı", "type": "LABORATORY", "isCritical": true, "demandKWh": 20 },
      { "id": "b2", "name": "Merkez Kütüphane", "type": "LIBRARY", "isCritical": true, "demandKWh": 15 },
      { "id": "b3", "name": "Öğrenci Yurdu A Blok", "type": "DORMITORY", "isCritical": false, "demandKWh": 30 }
    ]
  }
}

###

### 4. Smart Strategy - Fiyat Arbitrajı (Ucuz Elektrikte Bataryayı Koruma)
# Bu senaryoda şebeke elektriği çok ucuzdur (0.09 $/kWh <= 0.15).
# Batarya dolu olsa dahi harcanmaz, ucuz şebekeden alınarak batarya akşam pik saatine saklanır.
POST http://localhost:5000/api/energy/simulate-step
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "strategy": "SMART",
  "environment": {
    "timestamp": "2026-11-07T03:00:00Z",
    "solarGenerationKWh": 0.0,
    "isGridAvailable": true,
    "gridElectricityPrice": 0.09,
    "priceThresholdCheap": 0.15,
    "battery": {
      "currentCapacityKWh": 80.0,
      "maxCapacityKWh": 100.0,
      "minReservePercent": 20
    },
    "buildings": [
      { "id": "b1", "name": "Biyoteknoloji Laboratuvarı", "type": "LABORATORY", "isCritical": true, "demandKWh": 10 },
      { "id": "b2", "name": "Merkez Kütüphane", "type": "LIBRARY", "isCritical": true, "demandKWh": 8 },
      { "id": "b3", "name": "Öğrenci Yurdu A Blok", "type": "DORMITORY", "isCritical": false, "demandKWh": 12 }
    ]
  }
}

###

### 5. 24-Saatlik Senaryo Simülatörü ve Basic vs Smart Kıyaslama Raporu
POST http://localhost:5000/api/energy/run-scenario
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenarioName": "24-Saatlik Gerçek Zamanlı Kampüs Simülasyonu",
  "durationHours": 24,
  "gridOutageStartHour": 14,
  "gridOutageDurationHours": 4,
  "cloudyDayFactor": 0.85,
  "batteryCapacityKWh": 150,
  "initialBatteryKWh": 50,
  "priceModel": "TIME_OF_USE",
  "saveToDatabase": false
}

###

### 6. TimescaleDB Ham Metrikler (Son 50 Kayıt)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/energy/metrics?limit=50
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 7. TimescaleDB time_bucket() Özetlenmiş Saatlik Grafikler (Chart.js için)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/energy/metrics/aggregated?interval=1%20hour
Content-Type: application/json

